      "blockId": "tour:contentBlock_text:52666b03478dddce",
      "field": "contentBlock.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "384a1fadb752e69302970cfc5f3b218f47dd63046e629d9242a231cbd0ec60cd",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261107-w3975dff5b107",
        "model": "GPT-6.1-Sol"
      },
      "text": "Breakfast at the hotel. Take a sightseeing tour of Lima with an English-speaking guide, visiting Miraflores and Love Park, viewing Huaca Huallamarca from the outside, and visiting the main square and Santo Domingo Monastery. Visit the cathedral or, if it is closed, the Lima Art Museum (MALI)."
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:contentBlock_text:3ef01eac09960997",
      "field": "contentBlock.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "7c13e89c621df6b7a13a4ec474ea0e6be26cbe310d98ce7c987f7bcd3bfe1ad4",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261107-w3975dff5b107",
        "model": "GPT-6.1-Sol"
      },
      "text": "Your sightseeing tour with an English-speaking guide begins in Miraflores at Love Park, which overlooks the Pacific Ocean. Then drive past Huaca Huallamarca, a pre-Inca administrative and religious centre. Continue to the main square, home to the Presidential Palace and City Hall. Visit the cathedral or, if it is closed, the Lima Art Museum (MALI). Then walk to Santo Domingo Monastery and through the narrow streets where Saint Martin de Porres and Saint Rose of Lima once walked in the 17th century. Their remains are interred in the churches."
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:media_alt:f7e5d1b1cce98a0a",
      "field": "media.alt",
      "sourceTextSha256": "0d28ae9e71b868b43606b5eeab5d80b0e3b659160dd4ccc29d7744ca62114d10",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261107-w3975dff5b107",
        "model": "GPT-6.1-Sol"
      },
      "text": "Colourful mosaic benches in Love Park overlooking the Miraflores coast, Lima, Peru"
    },
